/Write a MARIE program to display 'N' if the value of R is less than zero. 
/Otherwise, display 'P'.
/如果 R < 0, 显示 N。其他情况显示 P
Load R
SkipCond 000        / 如果小于0，就跳过
Jump displayP
Jump displayN
displayP,   Load P
            Output
            Halt
displayN,   Load N
            Output
            Halt
R,      dec -10
N,      hex 4E
P,      hex 50